SUMMARY:König-Ludwig-Abendfahrt
LOCATION:Bootshafen Füssen (MS Füssen)\, Füssen
DESCRIPTION:Evening themed cruise with the Füssen historian Magnus Peresso
 n\, who brings the myth and building projects of König Ludwig II to life 
 while the ship passes views of the royal castles. Boarding from 19:00\, de
 parture 19:30\, about 2 hours. Adults 26 EUR\, children 13 EUR\; tickets o
 nline via the Forggensee-Schifffahrt shop or on board.
URL:https://www.forggensee-schifffahrt.de/veranstaltungen/
