SUMMARY:Ritterabenteuer auf der Burgruine Sulzberg
LOCATION:Burgruine Sulzberg (Treffpunkt Rathaus Sulzberg)\, Sulzberg
DESCRIPTION:Knight adventure afternoon for kids from age 5 with crossbow sh
 ooting\, lance games\, castle tower conquest\, fairy tales and a campfire 
 with sausages\, ending with a knighting ceremony and certificate for each 
 child. Meet at the Rathaus Sulzberg at 13:45\, then a short walk to the ca
 stle ruin. Costs 4 Euro for adults and 3 Euro for children. Registration r
 equired at the Gästeinformation Sulzberg\, phone 08376 9201-19.
URL:https://www.allgaeu.de/veranstaltungen/ritterabenteuer
CATEGORIES:medieval
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
